---
layout: base
title: Oliver
description: Oliver的个人技术博客 - 锂离子电池工艺工程
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="name">Oliver</h1>
  <p class="title">锂电高级工艺工程师</p>
  <p class="tagline">电极制造全流程工艺开发。涂布、辊压、化成——从浆料流变到SEI膜生长，将材料科学落地为可控、可重复的量产工艺。</p>
</section>

<section class="notes-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>最新笔记</h2>
    <a href="/notes/" class="view-all">查看全部</a>
  </div>
  
  {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
  {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
  <article class="note-card">
    <time class="note-date" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <h3 class="note-title"><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="note-excerpt">{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
  </article>
  {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
